/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D2/0/code.py:20:# Design analysis for the D2 variant
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D2/0/code.py:23:#    frame gap emits one straight outward ray. The visual change is entirely in collisions. Originally,
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D2/0/code.py:24:#    the first collision could create a gap, a redirected pair of rays, or a zigzag band. In the variant,
